  "date": "2026-11-09",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "银联说：从没发行过带银联标志的“社保卡金卡”",
  "title_en": "UnionPay says it has never issued a “social security gold card” carrying the UnionPay logo",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "11月6日，中国银联发表声明，说市面上有一种“社保卡金卡”，卡上印着银联的标志。",
      "en": "On November 6, China UnionPay issued a statement saying that a so-called “social security gold card” is on the market, with the UnionPay logo printed on it."
    },
    {
      "zh": "推广这种卡的人说，加入群以后，持卡人每个月可以拿到补贴。银联表示，自己从来没有和别人一起发行这种卡，也没有让任何机构发行。",
      "en": "The people promoting this card say that after joining a group, cardholders can get a subsidy every month. UnionPay said it has never issued this card together with anyone, and has not let any institution issue it."
    },
    {
      "zh": "银联还说，按照国家的规定，社保卡的样式是统一的蓝色。银联提醒大家，对不认识的“银行卡”和“社保福利”活动要小心。",
      "en": "UnionPay also said that under national rules, the social security card has one uniform style, which is blue. UnionPay reminded everyone to be careful with “bank cards” and “social security benefit” activities they do not know."
    },
    {
      "zh": "这是银联今年第二次发这样的声明。第一次在1月30日，内容是一种假的“农业专属卡”，它和高收益投资有关。银联说，自己没有做过这样的投资活动，别人没有允许就用银联标志，是严重的侵权。",
      "en": "This is the second statement of this kind that UnionPay has issued this year. The first was on January 30 and was about a fake “agriculture-exclusive card” linked to high-return investments. UnionPay said it has never run such investment activities, and that using its logo without permission is a serious infringement."
    }
  ],
